    "day": 1,
    "title": "Kaya's Morning Thoughts",
    "sentences": [
      "Kaya woke from her warm bed.",
      "It was a chilly Thursday in March.",
      "She sat at her desk and opened her notebook.",
      "A brown apple, yellow pencil, and red eraser were there.",
      "Kaya picked up her ink pen.",
      "Outside the window, a big tree stood.",
      "She remembered winter in February and December.",
